    {
      "add_paragraph": {
        "heading": "A field guide to the media elements",
        "text": "This area is a living reference for the content creation system. It uses every image and gallery element the shared engine can draw — single plates, side-by-side layouts, timed slideshows, grid and masonry galleries — so a new area can be written by copying the pattern it needs.\n\nPicture cards, people, 3D models, embedded media and publications now have their own page: {Picture cards|@research.picture_cards}.\n\nPictures may be written as a **bare filename** (looked up in this area's own image folder) or as a **path of your own** from the page root. Both are shown below."
      }
    },
